## Bicubic PatchMesh, periodic on both axes: nu=6 nv=3 under the default
## Bezier basis, three concentric hexagonal control rings (radius 0.45,
## 0.30, 0.15) each wrapping its last strip back to control point 0 --
## exercising GMANBasis::offset's wraparound on both axes at once, the
## case createParametric samples all the way to u=1.0 and v=1.0.
##
## A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
## desync convention."
Display "patchmesh_bicubic_periodic.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.6]
Sides 2
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [0]
AttributeBegin
	Translate -1 0 0
	PatchMesh "bicubic" 6 "periodic" 3 "periodic" "P" [
		 0.45     0.0     0   0.225    0.3897  0  -0.225    0.3897  0  -0.45     0.0     0  -0.225   -0.3897  0   0.225   -0.3897  0
		 0.3      0.0     0   0.15     0.2598  0  -0.15     0.2598  0  -0.3      0.0     0  -0.15    -0.2598  0   0.15    -0.2598  0
		 0.15     0.0     0   0.075    0.1299  0  -0.075    0.1299  0  -0.15     0.0     0  -0.075   -0.1299  0   0.075   -0.1299  0
	]
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
	Translate 1 0 0
	Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
